/*!
@page cloudquotas-override-universe-domain How to Override the Default Universe Domain

In some cases, you may need to override the default universe domain used by the
client library. Use `AddUniverseDomainOption` when initializing the client
library to change this default.

<!-- inject-universe-domain-snippet-start -->
For example, this will override the default universe domain for `cloudquotas_v1::CloudQuotasClient`:

@snippet cloud_quotas_client_samples.cc set-client-universe-domain

Follow these links to find examples for other \c *Client classes:

- [\c cloudquotas_v1::CloudQuotasClient](@ref cloudquotas_v1::CloudQuotasClient-universe-domain-snippet)
- [\c cloudquotas_v1::QuotaAdjusterSettingsManagerClient](@ref cloudquotas_v1::QuotaAdjusterSettingsManagerClient-universe-domain-snippet)

<!-- inject-universe-domain-snippet-end -->

*/

// <!-- inject-universe-domain-pages-start -->

/*! @page cloudquotas_v1::CloudQuotasClient-universe-domain-snippet Override cloudquotas_v1::CloudQuotasClient Universe Domain

@snippet google/cloud/cloudquotas/v1/samples/cloud_quotas_client_samples.cc set-client-universe-domain

*/

